<title>FRANCE: Via Banque 1996 net loss 170 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Via Banque 1996 net loss 170 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net				   loss     170  vs  loss    194</p>
<p>    Net consolidated attributable loss     165  vs  loss    220</p>
<p>    Net operating profit			  67  vs  profit  123</p>
<p>    Provisions					97  vs	     47</p>
<p>    Provisions for asset depreciation	135  vs	    247</p>
<p>NOTE - The company released the figures in a statement. Via Banque is controlled by Paribas through its unit Cie de Navigation Mixte.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
